  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for Femmes Actives et Citoyennet&#xE9; Engag&#xE9;e (FACE) project (Active Women and Committee Citizenship)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WELL is a Senegalese civil society organization of advocates and practitioners that have been working for 30-plus years to combat poverty in rural communities in Senegal through providing functional literacy, strengthening social and civic participation, as well as financial empowerment for women and girls. Through this grant, WELL will implement the second phase of the Femmes Actives et Citoyennet&#xE9; Engag&#xE9;e project to strengthen the power, decision making, and agency of women and girls in partner villages to expand their impact in the inclusive development of their communities. (Strategy: Inclusive Governance).</narrative>
  </description>
